SavedVariables and backups
-------------------------
The local companion can modify or remove SavedVariables and reset caches.
Keep an independent backup of your WTF folder, close all WoW clients before
applying changes, and review each operation. Backups and restoration features
do not guarantee recovery or compatibility with every addon or game version.
